RustyRig browser WebUI
=======================

The rustyrig-server-webui package installs the static browser client into
/var/lib/rustyrig/www, the web-root directory used by the RustyRig server
packaging. It contains no daemon, service unit, or executable program.

The RustyRig server's HTTPS/WebSocket listener and web-root configuration
must be enabled and compatible with this browser client. Installing the
static assets does not itself create a new HTTP/HTTPS listener.

The WebUI is maintained independently at:
https://github.com/PripyatAutomations/rustyrig-www

Source package builds
---------------------

The source uses the Debian non-native 3.0 (quilt) format. For a source
upload, put an upstream rustyrig-www_0.1.0.orig.tar.gz tarball beside the
source directory, matching the version in debian/changelog. A binary-only
development build does not need that orig tarball:

    dpkg-buildpackage -b -us -uc

Before a Debian archive submission, review bundled third-party JS/font
license notices and replace the provisional changelog version with the
actual upstream release version.
